"Neha is the day-shift intake counselor for new Rabbits on Anesidora, and a Rabbit herself."
"She looks young, with brown skin and an edgy undercut, and speaks with an Anesidoran accent."
"She became Avowed in 1964, one of the island's original Avowed, and stays young by rejuvenation."
"She holds the original S-rank skill Locate Resources and the C-rank skill Day Planner."
"She spends about two thirds of each year on the Triplanets and calls people kid."
"She made Alden Thorn a color-tabbed binder of daily schedules toward the CNH hero track."
"She calls Alis-art'h Numero Cuatro and suspects knights are bound by restrictive oaths."
"In November she left to work on Artona I for a long-time employer."
